                                <l xml:id="m-f686b905-df3d-41c3-b96a-1dc7c900a8e4" facs="#m-cdb33c50-7b82-4f57-965b-1e7b5593a030" label="ambiguous">to10</l><l xml:id="m-d86e1bb8-beac-4939-be66-077f8a64154a" facs="#m-51257913-23ed-4e06-b260-aa9a50c1fc14" label="text-like">7th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-65b3878d-ef87-463d-b414-6c31bb7be96a" facs="#m-be8cfc85-bc29-4de3-bb2f-7eed8784600a" label="lyrics-like">jubi- lá- te Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-795409f7-0d26-441f-8593-e20f01aeb811" facs="#m-3ea0c255-d503-47be-b5e6-b5778b9a51f7" label="lyrics-like">in vóce exsulta-ti- 6 nis.</l><l xml:id="m-d209a69f-cd28-4db4-876e-c72597585761" facs="#m-8518099e-259f-444c-937c-1574fd1b90f8" label="lyrics-like">Ps. Quóni- am Dóminus excélsus, terrí-bi-lis: “Rex mágnus</l><l xml:id="m-c1c1c802-ba13-4f11-8ee9-40c5bf238217" facs="#m-69482407-3f0b-486e-ba8c-7bd371b14c6c" label="lyrics-like">super ómnem térram. Gló-ri- a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-0b89ebf9-2f2a-411b-ad63-ec9c7ac28458" facs="#m-c09505c6-5903-4978-b0fc-b4b29bbbb5e1" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-aeb834ee-ac69-4793-bbd9-c6a822c55e6a" facs="#m-76a8c7be-472e-42ed-94ab-599c16c0403e" label="lyrics-like">Eus, cujus providéntia in sui cta submóveas, * et ómnia nobis</l><l xml:id="m-a46185b2-5f24-4cb3-b15f-9087cd57b816" facs="#m-b5fd44f6-c60d-49e4-b9df-b2c4e2d37bff" label="lyrics-like">dispositióne non fállitur:t te profutúra concédas. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e2c50f07-294f-4ee2-8f00-a80a49bd2da0" facs="#m-dfead7d4-2a8e-4b3a-8c9e-28c4e342cb7e" label="lyrics-like">súpplices exorámus; ut nóxia cun¬</l><l xml:id="m-aef8e451-f0d6-4cf4-a571-cc7a74821814" facs="#m-771b8a51-3895-441d-8934-d7290d8361bd" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-e2f95967-052c-4748-af91-0c6739302b32" facs="#m-54460e9b-4498-4f65-9e7d-1cbdfadd75f7" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Romanos. Rom. 6. d.</l><l xml:id="m-a373427f-87df-48cd-89b3-d12e7e623dda" facs="#m-79c6f0e0-8a25-4911-8194-32823e6fb6ce" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Humánum dico, pro-! habuístis tunc in illis, in quibus nunc</l><l xml:id="m-eb62e3e8-fe73-4a57-89e2-22ffb0aabe9e" facs="#m-44349dcc-3601-4851-8a7d-011ae36ee925" label="lyrics-like">pter infirmitátem carnis ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b927dd4-f25a-494c-8998-01e84b106032" facs="#m-5daf2968-4ab6-4606-8f07-d2454ce4c1ea" label="lyrics-like">erubéscitis? Nam finis illórum mors</l><l xml:id="m-8680fe2e-d5e6-4c2b-a02a-a80f09f74984" facs="#m-9d536049-a6a4-492c-9be0-f6362614137c" label="lyrics-like">strae: sicut enim exhibuístis mem¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9faa1d5-3503-4387-96e2-1d351c40ea67" facs="#m-8e9a8ae9-3111-4383-8ef5-041bd9523876" label="lyrics-like">est. Nunc vero liberáti a peccáto,</l><l xml:id="m-c9b5a8d0-5a9a-49b5-be89-74cd8dfcb642" facs="#m-3f310e0b-9a49-4148-83a7-2e65ced4ab01" label="lyrics-like">servi autem facti Deo, habétis fru¬</l><l xml:id="m-30b5021d-9b2d-4fcc-a588-32e3a942f773" facs="#m-a2dea198-9f6c-49c3-8428-23bc63b94382" label="lyrics-like">bra vestra servire immundítiae, et</l><l xml:id="m-cb9bbd34-3000-49d8-8947-1f3f6d5b21db" facs="#m-71c9cb10-7d39-4d78-bb4a-83d1a24b82fa" label="lyrics-like">iniquitáti ad iniquitátem, ita nunc</l><l xml:id="m-8a34150c-c7f4-40f8-a8f1-66efcb956c79" facs="#m-f2160f3d-199c-4372-b991-bd6336720763" label="lyrics-like">ctum vestrum in sanctificatiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-e1fb97f0-41b2-40bc-b206-5f8091fb48f4" facs="#m-9b186f0a-b957-4bb2-a8c1-24efeb11ccca" label="lyrics-like">exhibéte membra vestra servíre! finem vero vitam aetérnam. Sti¬</l><l xml:id="m-3e4c44a3-837b-4824-8b6c-024b7c9a61bf" facs="#m-aac7d59d-cb05-410b-a094-9fe9e2ab1f6d" label="lyrics-like">justitiae in sanctificatiónem. Cum ] péndia enim peccáti mors. Grátia</l><l xml:id="m-ebc5b8d1-9d1a-4c49-bfe1-6e46a2b78580" facs="#m-00d495d3-25b0-4012-90b7-17f0dafe5620" label="lyrics-like">enim servi essétis peccáti, liberi fuí-autem Dei, vita aetérna, in Christo</l><l xml:id="m-64f2f46e-f4db-4398-956e-c342311ee787" facs="#m-725f0d44-19e9-4d75-a892-48e589c78da2" label="lyrics-like">stis justítiae. Quem ergo fructum! Jesu Dómino nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-c825f7f4-d6af-4af0-8518-362a255b642d" facs="#m-8afaf875-04b5-41a9-bf40-a2c5fb418037" label="ambiguous">drad. E</l><l xml:id="m-7db464d5-d082-4bd5-b2d9-d7dfe8063435" facs="#m-9d560a3b-d6b7-41b3-ba58-391b4100b19e" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-e5394435-da4e-4555-9279-d2b619e1eb0f" facs="#m-77e732fe-7087-45c3-b55f-cecf4a4859c3" label="lyrics-like">4 Eni-te fi- li-i, * audí¬</l><l xml:id="m-c42444d9-c2e5-4f1f-aa5c-f2abe6791dc0" facs="#m-f25a8746-9087-4530-b15c-6050b655b1c2" label="lyrics-like">te me: timó-rem</l><l xml:id="m-884f42cd-ad0d-4cd5-81e6-805b62d12aea" facs="#m-0475fa5a-bf29-426c-adf0-9629b1a34c4a" label="lyrics-like">Dómi-ni docébo vos.</l><l xml:id="m-89b8d71d-bb8b-4ee3-aa51-4d641c740191" facs="#m-dcacb412-74f6-487a-91f0-224da9c16677" label="lyrics-like">V. Accédi-te</l><l xml:id="m-d50473d7-a8f5-4930-8d30-55521f261575" facs="#m-5d6efd77-c547-49a6-9250-c1e3f4459654" label="lyrics-like">ad é¬</l><l xml:id="m-76f8cd82-9bd8-4e15-b1e6-29aa315799a3" facs="#m-95bc293c-3386-40a9-8e90-aaf2b8abde27" label="ambiguous">um, et</l><l xml:id="m-5fe69bed-60f1-483b-8ab9-dc35e82ad459" facs="#m-d3969e6f-c99f-46b4-92ba-96eec7e31d47" label="lyrics-like">illumi-námi-ni:</l><l xml:id="m-9e27cab9-5b09-4aea-a64e-7ab1cb79e95b" facs="#m-9453f857-47ff-4b76-9eec-d49364b0626f" label="lyrics-like">et fá-ci-es véstrae “ non con-fun¬</l></lg>
